OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre near Piddington set
OL,4,Ato open in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn asylum centre on Ministry of Defence
OL,7,Fland near Piddington in Oxfordshire is
OL,8,Fset to open in April, according to the
OL,9,Flocal MP.
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat Calum Miller, the MP
OL,12,Ffor Bicester and Woodstock, said that
OL,13,Fduring a meeting with the minister for
OL,14,Fborder security and asylum, Anna
OL,15,FTurley, an updated timeframe for Site A
OL,16,Fat MoD Bicester had been revealed.
OL,18,FHe said there was "a target" for work
OL,19,Fto start on the centre, that would
OL,20,Fhouse up to 1,256 men, in January.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
