OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum centre near Piddington set
OL,4,Ato open in April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office did not comment on the
OL,7,Ftimeframe, but previously said the
OL,8,Fgovernment had saved #1bn by moving
OL,9,Fasylum seekers out of hotels since the
OL,10,Felection.
